   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICMPS 2022 Programme-Vatuvara Foundation-Canberra CANBERRA V073</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Northern Lau biodiversity project in Fiji, implemented by Vatuvara Foundation aims to contribute to the biodiversity and species conservation of Fiji. The objectives of the grant are to monitor sea turtle reproduction sites, providing valuable data for conservation works and to create local ecotourism. The key activities include training data gatherers, surveying nesting sites, reporting of findings and introducing tourists to the Foundations&apos; works in a sustainable manner</narrative>
  </description>
